    "source": "canonical written solution and executable program",
    "solution_steps": [
      "Scan columns left to right and collect each maximal run containing red cells as one group slot.",
      "Count every zero hole within each group's full row-by-column rectangle.",
      "Sort the complete source groups by increasing hole count.",
      "Clear the output to zero, preserving the zero separator-column structure.",
      "Copy each ranked group pattern into the corresponding original slot from left to right."
    ],
